e goods.\n○( ㄷ ), with delivery happening at destination and with the seller\nbeing responsible for the payment of import duty and applicable\ntaxes is the IncotermsⓇrule imposing on the seller the maximum\nlevel of obligation of all eleven IncotermsⓇrules.\n○A sale under ( ㄹ ) can be concluded naming only the place of\ndelivery,\neither\nat\nthe\nseller’s\npremises\nor\nelsewhere,\nwithout\nspecifying the precise point of delivery within that named place.\n①ㄱ: DPU,\nㄴ: EXW,\nㄷ: DDP,\nㄹ: FCA\n②ㄱ: DDP,\nㄴ: EXW,\nㄷ: DPU,\nㄹ: FAS\n③ㄱ: DPU,\nㄴ: FCA,\nㄷ: DAP,\nㄹ: FAS\n④ㄱ: DDP,\nㄴ: FAS,\nㄷ: DPU,\nㄹ: FCA\n⑤ㄱ: DAP,\nㄴ: FCA,\nㄷ: DDP,\nㄹ: FOB", "choices": [{"r": 0, "x0": 0.0, "y0": 317.4, "x1": 595.0, "y1": 339.7, "m": [64.0, 320.4, 76.0, 334.8]}, {"r": 0, "x0": 0.0, "y0": 339.7, "x1": 595.0, "y1": 361.9, "m": [64.0, 342.7, 76.0, 357.1]}, {"r": 0, "x0": 0.0, "y0": 361.9, "x1": 595.0, "y1": 384.2, "m": [64.0, 364.9, 76.0, 379.3]}, {"r": 0, "x0": 0.0, "y0": 384.2, "x1": 595.0, "y1": 406.5, "m": [64.0, 387.2, 76.0, 401.6]}, {"r": 0, "x0": 0.0, "y0": 406.5, "x1": 595.0, "y1": 429.2, "m": [64.0, 409.5, 76.0, 423.9]}], "orig": 120, "answer": [1]}]}